1
00:00:00,025 --> 00:00:02,365
Hello? It looks like blood.

2
00:00:02,528 --> 00:00:06,028
Did you even read the wikiHow link
I sent you on being goth?

3
00:00:06,365 --> 00:00:08,535
No, I'm behind on my wiki reading.

4
00:00:08,701 --> 00:00:11,541
(Raj:)I'm kind of on a John Grisham kick
right now.

5
00:00:11,954 --> 00:00:14,124
(Howard:)-What?
-I finished reading The Pelican Brief...

6
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,880
(Raj:)...and loved it so much,
I dived right into The Client.

7
00:00:17,042 --> 00:00:21,382
(Raj:)He was a lawyer himself, so his novels
are accurate as well as entertaining.

8
00:00:22,465 --> 00:00:27,345
(Howard:)Just remember, we are lost boys.
Children of the night.

9
00:00:27,511 --> 00:00:31,051
(Raj:)Great. Lost boys, children of the night.
Got it.

10
00:00:32,016 --> 00:00:33,346
Can you pass the Chex Mix, please?

11
00:00:33,517 --> 00:00:34,847
[HOWARD SIGHS]

12
00:00:36,312 --> 00:00:37,562
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

13
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,230
(Howard:)We are lost boys.

14
00:00:45,237 --> 00:00:46,567
(Girl:)Good for you.

15
00:00:46,739 --> 00:00:50,579
I'm actually much more lost than he is.

16
00:00:51,869 --> 00:00:52,949
(Girl:)Nice ink.

17
00:00:53,746 --> 00:00:56,586
(Penny:)Thanks.
Can we buy you ladies a drink?

18
00:00:57,917 --> 00:00:59,047
(Girl:)Two light beers.

19
00:00:59,418 --> 00:01:03,168
Light beers. Well, wikiHow about that?

